  ...
  Exception: bb.process.ExecutionError: Execution of 'useradd-dep/1.0-r1/temp/run.useradd_sysroot.8980' failed with exit code 1:
    useradd-dep/1.0-r1/recipe-sysroot-native/usr/sbin/useradd
